---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectIndex from '../components/ProjectIndex.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { selectedProjects } from '../data/projects';
---

<BaseLayout title="Theresia | Applied AI" description="Theresia builds useful Applied AI systems around what actually needs to happen.">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Applied AI · Systems · Problem ownership</p>
      <h1>Useful working systems, built around what actually needs to happen.</h1>
      <p class="hero-claim">I care more about whether something actually solves the problem than how technically impressive the solution is.</p>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p>When I start a project, I first want to understand what the person actually needs, what the solution has to do, and what would make it useful. I haven't made a technical decision yet at that point. Once the problem is clear, the technical choices become much easier to reason about.</p>
        <p>That's how I approach Applied AI. The technology matters, but only because it has to produce something useful in the real world. Sometimes that means a machine learning model. Sometimes it means an automated workflow, an AI system, or something much simpler.</p>
        <p>I'm looking for an Applied AI role at an early-stage startup where I can work on problems that aren't already neatly mapped out. I want to build systems, own problems, and see the result actually get used.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/projects">View my work →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-portrait">
      <img src="/images/theresia-portrait.jpeg" alt="Theresia Saumu smiling against a warm brown background." width="582" height="548" />
      <figcaption>Theresia Saumu</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="selected-work shell" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2 id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ProjectIndex projects={selectedProjects} featured />
  </section>

  <div class="cta-wrap shell">
    <CTA title="Give me one problem you'd like solved by next week." body="Give me one scoped problem. I'll spend a week building a solution and you can decide if you want me on the team." />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
